           RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}], "=", "tab"}], ";", "\n", 
         RowBox[{"i", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"i", "+", "1"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"vm", "=", 
          RowBox[{"vm", "+", 
           FractionBox["196", "800"]}]}], ";"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "Rlist"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "]"}]}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"CRvmTESRight", "[", 
    RowBox[{"md_", ",", "n_"}], "]"}], "[", 
   RowBox[{"E1_", ",", "E2_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"vm", ",", "Rlist", ",", "tab"}], "}"}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"vm", "=", "5"}], ";", "\n", 
     RowBox[{"i", "=", "1"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"Rlist", "=", 
      RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", "800"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"While", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"vm", "<=", "200"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"tab", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{".01", "eV", "*", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"KerRAlr", "[", "md", "]"}], "[", "n", "]"}], "[", 
                RowBox[{"w", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"TESsig", "*", "w"}]}], "]"}], "[", 
               RowBox[{"vm", " ", "kps"}], "]"}], ")"}]}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"w", ",", "E1", ",", "E2", ",", ".01"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], 
          "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Rlist", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}], "=", "tab"}], ";", "\n", 
        RowBox[{"i", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"i", "+", "1"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"vm", "=", 
         RowBox[{"vm", "+", 
          FractionBox["196", "800"]}]}], ";"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "Rlist"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   "]"}]}]}], "Code",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.964488349592579*^9, 3.964488386442589*^9}, {
   3.9644884221245117`*^9, 3.964488605521063*^9}, 3.965279162578045*^9, {
   3.971956393245289*^9, 3.971956401990809*^9}, 3.97196062229151*^9, {
   3.978437732850483*^9, 3.978437745225322*^9}, {3.97843780662819*^9, 
   3.978437829782372*^9}, {3.978437929279895*^9, 3.978438039054306*^9}, {
   3.978438115265267*^9, 3.9784381201417*^9}, {3.978438805530942*^9, 
   3.978438823633282*^9}, {3.97843889300978*^9, 3.9784388978644037`*^9}, {
   3.978438930783528*^9, 3.978438996733739*^9}, {3.978439485435546*^9, 
   3.978439500506619*^9}, {3.978439551477407*^9, 3.978439557137105*^9}, {
   3.978439591212557*^9, 3.978439596188261*^9}, {3.978448414194089*^9, 
   3.978448416633664*^9}, {3.979689798157338*^9, 3.979689944132135*^9}, {
   3.979689995674491*^9, 3.979689997912716*^9}, {3.9797005774797993`*^9, 
   3.979700621415428*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[128]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e30287af-b94f-d840-b6b6-769fce05e7d5"],

Cell["\<\
(* Continuous-vm versions of CRvmTES* *)
(* vm \:3092\:30b5\:30f3\:30d7\:30ea\:30f3\:30b0\:305b\:305a\:3001numeric \
\:306a vm \:5024\:3067\:306e w \:7a4d\:5206\:3092\:8fd4\:3059\:3002 *)
(* CRTES[md, n][E1, E2][vm] is a continuous function of vm (km/s value). *)
CRTES[md_, n_][E1_, E2_][vm_?NumericQ] := Total[Table[
  0.01 eV * (
    KerRAll[md][n][w, TESsig*w][vm*kps] +
    KerRAlr[md][n][w, TESsig*w][vm*kps]
  ),
  {w, E1, E2, 0.01}
]];

CRTESLeft[md_, n_][E1_, E2_][vm_?NumericQ] := Total[Table[
  0.01 eV * KerRAll[md][n][w, TESsig*w][vm*kps],
  {w, E1, E2, 0.01}
]];

CRTESRight[md_, n_][E1_, E2_][vm_?NumericQ] := Total[Table[
  0.01 eV * KerRAlr[md][n][w, TESsig*w][vm*kps],
  {w, E1, E2, 0.01}
]];\
\>", "Input",
 InitializationCell->True,
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.98, 0.95, 0.95],ExpressionUUID->"3fcbbec6-be07-444e-9f3c-cd4a872c7f7e"],

Cell["\<\
\[FilledSquare] CRintTES, CRintTESLeft, CRintTESRight, CRintTESWeighted   \
\[LongDash] vm \:65b9\:5411\:7a4d\:5206 (midpoint rule)

\:5b9a\:7fa9:
  CRintTES[md, n][E1, E2][vmin, vmax, nsamples]
    = \[Integral]_vmin^vmax CRTES[md, n][E1, E2][vm] dvm
    \[TildeTilde] dvm \[Times] \[CapitalSigma]_{i=1..nsamples} CRTES[md, \
n][E1, E2][vm_i]
    \:3053\:3053\:3067 vm_i = vmin + (i - 0.5) \[CenterDot] dvm,  dvm = (vmax \
- vmin) / nsamples

\:5f15\:6570:
  \[Bullet] md           DM \:8cea\:91cf
  \[Bullet] n            \:5a92\:4ecb\:5b50\:30e2\:30c7\:30eb (1/2/3)
  \[Bullet] E1, E2       \:89b3\:6e2c\:30a8\:30cd\:30eb\:30ae\:30fc bin (eV)
  \[Bullet] vmin, vmax   vm \:7a4d\:5206\:7bc4\:56f2 (km/s, \:6570\:5024)
  \[Bullet] nsamples     \:30b5\:30f3\:30d7\:30ea\:30f3\:30b0\:70b9\:6570 (\
\:6574\:6570)

\:7a2e\:985e:
  \[Bullet] CRintTES        \:4e21\:30d6\:30e9\:30f3\:30c1\:548c\:306e vm \
\:7a4d\:5206
  \[Bullet] CRintTESLeft    \:5de6\:30d6\:30e9\:30f3\:30c1\:306e\:307f
  \[Bullet] CRintTESRight   \:53f3\:30d6\:30e9\:30f3\:30c1\:306e\:307f
  \[Bullet] CRintTESWeighted   etaFunc[vm] \:3092\:639b\:3051\:3066\:7a4d\
\:5206 (\:30cf\:30ed\:901f\:5ea6\:5206\:5e03 \[Eta](vm) \:7528)

\:4f8b:
  result = CRintTES[100 MeV, 1][1.0, 1.5][5, 200, 100]
  result = CRintTESWeighted[100 MeV, 1][1.0, 1.5][5, 200, 100, etaSHM]\
\>", "Text",
 Background->RGBColor[0.95, 0.98, 0.95],
 CellTags->"doc",ExpressionUUID->"7a49053d-e22e-420a-a0ac-2e3eb6ef4a3d"],

Cell["\<\
(* Velocity-integrated versions of CRTES* *)
(* Midpoint rule: nsamples \:306e\:70b9\:3092 [vmin, vmax] \:306e\:4e2d\:70b9\
\:3067\:30b5\:30f3\:30d7\:30ea\:30f3\:30b0\:3001dvm = (vmax-vmin)/nsamples \
\:3092\:639b\:3051\:3066\:548c\:3092\:53d6\:308b\:3002 *)
CRintTES[md_, n_][E1_, E2_][vmin_?NumericQ, vmax_?NumericQ, nsamples_Integer] \
:= Module[
  {dvm, vmList},
  dvm = (vmax - vmin) / nsamples;
  vmList = Table[vmin + (i - 0.5) dvm, {i, 1, nsamples}];
  Total[CRTES[md, n][E1, E2][#] & /@ vmList] * dvm
];

CRintTESLeft[md_, n_][E1_, E2_][vmin_?NumericQ, vmax_?NumericQ, \
nsamples_Integer] := Module[
  {dvm, vmList},
  dvm = (vmax - vmin) / nsamples;
  vmList = Table[vmin + (i - 0.5) dvm, {i, 1, nsamples}];
  Total[CRTESLeft[md, n][E1, E2][#] & /@ vmList] * dvm
];

CRintTESRight[md_, n_][E1_, E2_][vmin_?NumericQ, vmax_?NumericQ, \
nsamples_Integer] := Module[
  {dvm, vmList},
  dvm = (vmax - vmin) / nsamples;
  vmList = Table[vmin + (i - 0.5) dvm, {i, 1, nsamples}];
  Total[CRTESRight[md, n][E1, E2][#] & /@ vmList] * dvm
];

(* Halo-weighted version: \:901f\:5ea6\:5206\:5e03\:95a2\:6570 etaFunc[vm] \
\:3092\:639b\:3051\:3066\:7a4d\:5206 *)
CRintTESWeighted[md_, n_][E1_, E2_][vmin_?NumericQ, vmax_?NumericQ, \
nsamples_Integer, etaFunc_] := Module[
  {dvm, vmList},
  dvm = (vmax - vmin) / nsamples;
  vmList = Table[vmin + (i - 0.5) dvm, {i, 1, nsamples}];
  Total[(CRTES[md, n][E1, E2][#] * etaFunc[#]) & /@ vmList] * dvm
];\
\>", "Input",
 InitializationCell->True,
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.95, 0.98, 0.95],ExpressionUUID->"8ff9034c-064b-4ccc-acbd-e1acc8c65606"],


}, Open  ]]
